{
  "name": "seal-factory-refusals",
  "vectorFormat": "sealer-factory-refusal-v2",
  "description": "Refusals of Sealers built through the factory from plain setup. Values are JSON, with the tagged values of the test bridge frames at any depth (js/test-bridges/_shared/CONTRACT.md): {\"$type\":\"Uint8Array\",\"base64url\":...} is a byte string in unpadded base64url, {\"$type\":\"Date\",\"iso\":...} is a UTC instant with milliseconds, and {\"$type\":\"Record\",\"value\":{...}} is an ordinary record that has a $type member. Decode the whole record with that one codec before a replay reads it. input.setup is the setup of a sealer-factory-v3 record; set and unset name members as the factory takes them. For each entry of cases, lay the members of set over input.setup, remove the members named in unset, and build the Sealer with your port's mapped factory. Then make the calls in order: each is [member, args] on the Sealer. The last call must refuse, or the factory itself when calls is empty or absent, with a DCA error whose code is expected.code; the calls before it must not refuse. A port may refuse at once or through a promise. The message is the port's own and is not pinned.",
  "input": {
    "setup": {
      "origin": "https://www.news-site.example",
      "signingKid": "sign-2025-10",
      "issuers": [
        {
          "issuerName": "paywall_subscription_service",
          "keyId": "2025-10",
          "algorithm": "ecdh-p256"
        }
      ],
      "fixedInstant": {
        "$type": "Date",
        "iso": "2025-10-23T14:20:00.000Z"
      },
      "randomStream": {
        "$type": "Uint8Array",
        "base64url": "jh_hn_zoThuHc0mC1e_4orCEc0om_kLDe5oB9MilIytJhE1tzcWQC73GD0o"
      },
      "testKeyDocuments": {
        "signingKeys": {
          "sign-2025-10": "-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\nMIGHAgEAMBMGByqGSM49AgEGCCqGSM49AwEHBG0wawIBAQQg7O8VtGxSny/jVf0D\nTjDtzhrSwJJXy6MFOcFHjeyM0oihRANCAASG7kcwEmbWL8OZzn5Op+cM+XIGEddc\nzLTv8Ed6ieAFYxSThUQ5PCT3TOOlPrnNt+NfuYJdOKomOLim2XmPfmBY\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----\n"
        },
        "issuerPublicKeys": {
          "2025-10": "-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----\nMFkwEwYHKoZIzj0CAQYIKoZIzj0DAQcDQgAEuXUf+qgjGmMkv5rRX+wv2KR7RrP5\nl7+s8I/QbvWZyrO3bignf8lM4cxuA612rVe0v+TqU2N+C1MeK3e1EfqNNw==\n-----END PUBLIC KEY-----\n"
        }
